      "mergedPostDetails": "The current brightness of the gesture indicators came off as a little distracting at first. While one can get used to them over time, they will still be way too apparent on recordings, especially to other viewers. The opacity of the indicators can be reduced to 70% or 80% to make them less distracting.\n\nThis was found to be a duplicate of the following posts:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1216-allow-gesture-indicator-to-have-custom-opacity\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1216-gesture-indicator-transparency-and-fade-out\nGive them a vote as well.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1216] [FEEDBACK] The gesture indicator opacity can be reduced",
      "parentID": "62e57ac085365344b7bdcc38",
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
