      "mergeID": "62e9b45f4a3c6c44ac3abb3e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "# Issue:\nThe current Icons for the Gesture Indicator feel a bit out of place and do not fit with the rest of the game, they are also way to intrusive.\n# Suggestion:\n1. Replace the icons with a more simplistic outline, maybe take a look at the ones Moon used for his Avatar based Gesture Indicator: https://twitter.com/MOONVRCHAT/status/1552173671959216128?s=20&t=ajPCYY66FepBJ28320q8iQ \n2. Make them transparent, that way they aren’t just two big white blobs on your screen.\n3. Add a “Gesture Indicator Fadeout” Toggle, some people only want to see the Indicator for a few seconds after doing a Gesture, some others want to see it the whole time. With a toggle, both people are happy.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1216] Change the design of the Gesture Indicator",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "62e4f26e5b260144ac105e6a",
