      "mergedPostDetails": "The gesture indicator is nice, but currently when you do a gesture and then lock your gestures, the hand icon shows up on your screen forever afterwards showing the gesture you're doing. \nIf I want do a happy face ^^ with my hand open., and I then gesture lock it so I have it on for a few minutes, I don't want the hand open gesture icon to also be showing up the entire time in my field of vision.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1216] Gesture Indicator - Allow to have the gesture icon disappear when gesture locked",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "62e4f26e5b260144ac105e6a",
